# Lisp workspace (egao1980)

Canonical always-on policy: **AGENTS.md**. Prefs + stack index: **MEMORY.md**. Do not restate those here.

- **Layout:** versioned Cursor config = `.lisp-workspace/.cursor/` (root `.cursor` should symlink here). Skills = `.lisp-workspace/skills/` (`.cursor/skills` → `../skills`).
- **CFFI natives:** `load-foreign-library` at ASDF load (absolute preload). Consumers: `(asdf:load-system "…")` is enough — no `load-*` / `ensure-*`.
- **Long-running commands:** `cmd > /tmp/out.log 2>&1 || { tail -50 /tmp/out.log; exit 1; }`. Do not ingest full compile/install progress.
